%% Phase5 / CHAIN / CHAIN-COM-G05 汇总计数
%% 机器真源: phase5.manifest.json；post_chain_append；ChainSummary；ChainProjectionStore
sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Chain card
  participant F as ChainFacadeService
  participant T as Tauri im_post_chain_append
  participant H as Helix chain reducer
  participant G as Go append handler
  participant PG as PostgreSQL chain/entry/participant
  participant DB as SQLite chain_summary/entry
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant S as ChainProjectionStore
  UI->>F: append(...)
  F->>T: im_post_chain_append
  T->>H: Tick::Command(post_chain_append)
  H->>G: POST /api/cses/post-chain/append
  G->>PG: append entry and update authoritative counts
  G-->>H: summary + entry
  H->>DB: PersistAtomic summary/entry/window/mutation
  DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
  H->>B: im:post_chain:upsert
  B->>S: chainById / entriesById
  S-->>UI: chain-summary-counts / chain-entry-count
